</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>This function  is not visible to ordinary <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/unqualified_lookup\">unqualified</a> or <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/qualified_lookup\">qualified lookup</a>, and can only be found by <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/adl\">argument-dependent lookup</a> when <code>stride_view::<i>iterator</i>&lt;Const&gt;</code> is an associated class of the arguments.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> i\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/stride_view/iterator\">iterator</a>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The result of applying <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ranges/iter_move\">ranges::iter_move</a></span> to the stored iterator.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<div class=\"t-noexcept-full\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/language/noexcept_spec\"><code>noexcept</code></a> specification:&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<div class=\"t-noexcept-box\"><span class=\"t-cc\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ranges/iter_move\"><span class=\"kw3158\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">iter_move</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>i.<span class=\"me1\">current_</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></span></div></div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ranges/iter_move\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>iter_move</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> casts the result of dereferenc